    {
      "id": "map_national_status",
      "info": "Every registered asset, coloured by whether its latest monitoring found it working.\nEach family answers this under its own question and option set: station_status on pump stations (operational / blocked / overflowing / not_operational), system_status on EPS (operational / issue_with_system), infrastructure_status on RWS (operational / non_operational). Anything not listed as functional counts as non-functional.\nWWTP and WTP have no plant-level status question on either monitoring form, so their sites are always grey. That is a gap in the forms, not a finding about those plants — see issue #34 G1.\nGrey also covers a site whose family asks the question but which has not been monitored yet. An unanswered status is not evidence of a fault, so it is never coloured as one.",
      "chart_type": "multi_asset_map",
      "order": 10,
      "col_span": 24,
      "height": 520,
      "zoom": 7,
      "label": "Asset Status Nationwide",
      "description": "Every registered asset, by whether its latest monitoring found it operational.",
      "sources": [
